Subtask 2.3: Analyze Security Issues
Review the Checkov output and identify security issues. Common issues you'll see:

• S3 bucket public access: The bucket allows public access • Missing encryption: S3 bucket doesn't have encryption enabled • No versioning: S3 bucket versioning is not enabled • Missing access logging: No access logs configured

