Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Terraform Provider Download Fails
Problem: Terraform init fails to download providers

Solution:

# Clear Terraform cache and reinitialize
rm -rf .terraform
rm .terraform.lock.hcl
terraform init
Issue 2: Checkov Command Not Found
Problem: Checkov is not installed or not in PATH

Solution:

# Install Checkov using pip
pip3 install --user checkov
# Add to PATH if needed
export PATH=$PATH:~/.local/bin
Issue 3: OPA Policy Evaluation Fails
Problem: OPA cannot evaluate the policy

Solution:

# Test OPA policy syntax
opa fmt policies/s3-security-policy.rego
# Test policy with sample data
opa eval -d policies/s3-security-policy.rego "data.pulumi.s3"
Issue 4: Pulumi Stack Not Found
Problem: Pulumi cannot find the specified stack

Solution:

# Create a new stack
pulumi stack init dev
# Or select existing stack
pulumi stack select dev
